// A build program's (spec 7.9) expression #runs may make workspaces too:
// a constant's #run runs while checking (spec 7.8), so rig check runs it,
// and accepts it. The workspace it made counts as one a top-level #run
// makes, so rig build finds it has no files, at the create_workspace call's
// name. rig check never builds, so it has nothing to say.
#import "Compiler";

W :: #run create_workspace("game");
